  "description": "A comprehensive .NET 9 data access and service layer framework. Features include unified data store abstractions (SQL/File-based), CRUD service patterns with caching, attribute-driven data encryption, dynamic SQL operations, and extensive data manipulation utilities. Supports multiple database providers (SQL Server, SQLite, ODBC) with built-in security, logging, and performance optimizations.",
